<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Bryan Fury's Taunt B4 (LEFT SIDE)</Major>
    <Description>This is a macro for bryan fury's iconic taunt b4 for wall pressure etc, It is a macro script which will work in mostly 99% of the times. For this to work, follow these instructions in order to map your inputs for this macro to work:

Keyboard settings on tekken 8:
I = Triangle / Y / 2 Input 
O = Circle / B / 4 Input
J = Square / X / 1 Input
K = X / A / 3 Input

After mapping this, go to controller setup on tekken 8 and map the U button to 1+3+4 input (Taunt button). After mapping all these correctly, this macro will work perfectly!
(ONLY WORKS ON THE LEFT SIDE)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 24 1
Delay 440 ms
KeyUp 24 1
Delay 25 ms
KeyDown 4 1
KeyDown 18 1
Delay 45 ms
KeyUp 18 1
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 64 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tekken 8</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>